notes.content:
Dear players,



In this update, we --



Added new item: Fragrant Grease (enchanting an item with it can temporarily increase the customer’s Deal Range);
[p align="justify"]Added new item: Smoking Doll (placing it into an enemy’s backpack continuously releases smoke);



Remade the employee recruitment process;
[p align="justify"]Updated parts of the UI;
[p align="justify"]Adjusted base item values;



Fixed the bug where grease occasionally could not be used;
[p align="justify"]Fixed the bug where the Boss could not move after revival;
[p align="justify"]Fixed the bug where the Boss’s backpack was empty under certain circumstances;
[p align="justify"]Fixed the bug where the interface became disordered after the shop reached level 5;
[p align="justify"]Fixed the bug where the bottom of the warehouse was blocked by other pages;



We will keep updating this demo while spending most of our time working on the rest of the game.

Thank you again for your feedback!
